>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Interactively reviewed graph. Ru–N–O 175.88°, N–O 1.16300 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.8304. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge +2 and total charge +0. The original report on the same-composition Ru nitrosyl discusses IR and electronic spectra. The authors assign Ru(II)/NO⁺ to this series. Deposited crystal and ligand identities were checked, Different salts of the same ion were distinguished. The atom order and coordinates of all 26 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 19 nonmetal covalent bonds: 18 within range, 0 outside range and 1 with sparse controls.

