>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Manually reviewed Lewis representation. Fe–N–O 169.03°, N–O 1.19201 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.6065. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge -2 and total charge +0. The authors distinguish {Fe(NO)₂}¹⁰ from oxidized {Fe(NO)₂}⁹ by EPR, IR and crystallography; This electron count alone does not assign charges to the two individual NO groups. A source representation differs from the reference. The atom order and coordinates of all 29 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 25 nonmetal covalent bonds: 23 within range, 0 outside range and 2 with sparse controls.

